WEBVTT

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:08.540
Is it you, Min-chan?

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:13.380
<b>Sixth Day as a Superhero: "A Somewhat Heart-Racing Development"</b>

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:13.950
Who?

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:18.970
Hey, are your people still set on invading?

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:21.860
No. I'm simply a plebeian now.

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:23.510
Here on private business.

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:25.000
I have no plans of invading.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.310
Oh? You even forgot what 
your fiancée looks like?

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:29.800
What's with her? She talked 
without any mouth flaps.

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:31.090
That cut will have be redone.

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:34.160
You're going after Min-chan 
despite having a fiancée?

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.570
You weren't a sad, lonely man?

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.250
Huh? I have no idea about this.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:40.260
I don't have a fiancée.

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:43.130
Oh, on this planet, is it normal to 
have some fiancée show up randomly?

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:43.940
Or is it a scam?

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:46.660
Did you forget what you did to me?

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:49.660
Or do you not have the balls to admit it?

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:51.090
I haven't heard of a backstory like that!

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.990
You're going to play dumb, you scum?

00:01:53.990 --> 00:01:56.710
I fell in first love with Min-chan 
and gave up everything to be here!

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:57.930
Who the hell is Min-chan?!

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:02.220
<b>Old Man's Only Daughter
<b>Min-chan (16)
</b></b>

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:02.220
<b>Occupation: High School Girl (Black Belt in Karate)
Ideal Man: A mellow, gentle guy
Personality: Straightforward and Unyielding
Three Sizes: Don't ask, moron!</b>

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.870
Oh, you're still here.

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:02.350
Thanks for fixing the tap.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:05.240
So you're Min-chan?

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:07.310
I'm gonna kill you!

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:09.340
Watch out, Min-chan!

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:15.670
Don't ask who I am.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:19.010
If anything, I'm merely 
a wandering passer-by.

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:22.180
Fiercely attracted to you, 
I decided to stay here.

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:23.410
And now, I'll die here.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:24.660
That's all.

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.360
Wow, you talked a lot. 
Did you practice those lines?

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:28.390
By the way, your body...

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:32.140
Don't look! I bet there's a flower 
blooming in vivid crimson there!

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:33.810
Don't blame yourself.

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:37.210
This is a flower of love I'm 
offering you of my own free will!

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:39.840
You haven't taken any damage, though.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.040
Huh?

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:47.770
You know you shouldn't needlessly hurt 
people, brat! What're you, a slasher?!

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:51.100
Did you parents teach you nothing? 
I'm gonna get mad and hit you!

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.580
Of course! I saw this coming!

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.940
Youngsters' favorite skill, 
"I can't hear your lectures."

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:58.360
If you hold her there, she'll get mad.

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:02.480
Hey, you shitty fatty! Unhand me already!

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:04.700
My dataline got cut because 
you're holding it!

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:05.910
What?!

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:07.760
Her tail talked?!

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:10.330
That's right. I'm the actual body.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.250
<b>Moemoe's Fiancée
(Dataling)</b>

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.250
And I'm Moemoe's fiancée.

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:16.780
Back then, I was still 
in fourth space grade.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:19.130
Suddenly a flashback, Moemoe?

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:23.140
I was being educated to 
become a worthy king.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:26.430
That afternoon, the wind was calm, 
and the weather was wonderful.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.170
I was suddenly assailed by 
an intense stomachache.

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:32.270
In a rush, I carelessly 
entered the girls' bathroom.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.750
Huh? Oh, no!

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:36.210
I haven't seen anything, ladies!

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:37.610
Save me...

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:39.280
<i>Who's there?</i>

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:41.390
A girl's voice, asking for help?

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:44.590
<i>I forgot all about my need to shit and 
became a white knight in my mind.</i>

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.390
<i>And the moment I opened that door,</i>

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:49.760
<i>my heart was filled with excitement and joy.</i>

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.620
Somebody help!

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:54.590
Hey, what's the matter?

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:57.530
You shouldn't drink from the pot, 
no matter how thirsty you are.

00:03:57.530 --> 00:04:00.320
Stupid! Idiot! I'm not drinking 
from it, I'm dumping into it!

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.920
What? Her tail talked?

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:04.850
Rude! We're a race of tentacle beings

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:07.050
that're the smartest in 
the universe, datalings!

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.930
A dataling's real body is the dataline that

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:11.920
transmits, collects, and analyzes data.

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:15.750
The other, humanoid part is a multipurpose 
control carrier called a mobile battery.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.850
The mobile battery can not only 
provide energy to the real body,

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:20.930
it can also connect to all 
sorts of external devices.

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:24.730
USB 3.0, mobile phones, 
game controllers, power outlets, etc.

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:25.570
What kind of all-powerful device is that?

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:27.170
And its most important function

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:27.170
Does it have all the necessary licenses?

00:04:27.170 --> 00:04:29.190
is to discharge filth.

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:30.100
In the end, it is a gross system.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.330
Don't try to look cool!

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.960
So, how can I help?

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:37.460
The most difficult problem in the world.

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:39.270
I took a dump,

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.940
but then found that there 
was no more toilet paper!

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.750
That day,

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.150
I made close contact for the 
first time with the creature

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:49.970
that would later proclaim 
herself my fiancée.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:53.760
Soon after, she randomly 
considered me her boyfriend

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:55.490
and chased me around all the time.

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:03.980
Don't you realize that 
there's no future for us?

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:06.280
Because my mobile battery 
is unprepossessing...

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.110
Because it's ugly?!

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:10.660
That's not it.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:14.210
Our appearances and biological 
characteristics are totally different.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.300
You know it's not just a 
matter of your mobile battery.

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:18.410
I won't discriminate!

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:21.610
In my eyes, you look just like us!

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:20.750
<b>Slim!</b>

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.630
<b></b>Slim!

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:25.820
And the way you see the world is 
different than the way we see it.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:30.430
I would never marry her!

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:33.450
What are you saying? You touched her <i>there</i>.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:41.900
<b>Planet Tenaricent
Great Emperor</b>

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:35.330
You have no choice but to get married.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:39.170
Besides, datalings are the 
richest race in space.

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:41.900
They're ideal marriage partners.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.630
Forgive me, Father.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:47.610
<b>Planet Tenaricent
Great Emperor</b>

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:47.610
I'm going on a trip to conquer my own planet 
and yet-unseen wife with my own hands!

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:52.870
And so, I came to this planet.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:56.700
I see. So the Earth invasion premise 
had a bit of backstory, huh?

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:58.070
Must be rough being a prince.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:05:59.700
Way to go, dude.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.920
<i>Earth invasion? Are they kids?</i>

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.060
It didn't go well at first 
because I ran into you.

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.640
Oh, is that so?

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:06.750
The other day, I wanted to use a 
light speed electromagnetic cannon,

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:06.440
I totally get it.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:09.620
but to fire it, gravity waves from the

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:09.010
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:13.320
Oh, is that why? That's a surprise!

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:11.850
16th comet of the solar system was needed.

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:14.010
<i>Ugh, they're chuu2?</i>

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:15.270
I can't deal with this.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:19.900
I feel so stupid for thinking, 
even for a moment, that he was my father!

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:22.430
Hey, those hearts are annoying to draw.

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:25.900
I hate to admit it, but the prince 
is head over heels for Min-chan.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:27.960
The doctor's here!

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.930
Oh, a patient? Are you alive?

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:31.740
Breathe in, breathe out!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.200
Emergency treatment!

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:35.110
Don't tell me, he...

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:35.110
Huh? What?

00:06:35.110 --> 00:06:36.270
What's gonna happen to me?

00:06:35.110 --> 00:06:36.790
Yamada-san's going for it.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:37.640
Who the heck is Yamada?!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:39.230
Heaven, Earth, and all the people

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:41.200
call me the Suckmaster!

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.890
I've imagined doing this so many times.

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:44.800
My sweet dream will now...

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:46.360
come true.

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:50.910
Circle, dot, you've got the cootie shot.

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:52.740
That's not her mouth. It's her ass.

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:54.720
Suck in, breathe out, and suck in again.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.180
Stop it!

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:58.680
Not there!

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:00.870
Anywhere but there!

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:01.730
Damn, that's gross.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.640
Say, do you think

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:06.360
she'll break off our engagement after this?

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:07.960
Hell...

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.200
This is a vision of hell.

00:07:09.230 --> 00:07:11.210
Yes!

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:12.890
Especially since this show airs in the evening...

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:13.670
Excellent!

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:19.960
I don't understand why Brother is 
obsessed with this tiny planet.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:22.220
I'll put him in his place.

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:26.310
It's just absurd the guy doing the

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:29.010
CPR passed out due to lack of oxygen.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.700
Heave Ho!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:34.340
Anyway, are you going to

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:36.340
stay on Earth forever?

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:37.250
Yeah.

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:40.850
At the very least, I won't leave 
until I capture Min-chan's heart.

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:44.280
But if you stay here,

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:47.610
Min-chan might get mixed up in more danger.

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.470
Maybe so.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:51.580
But I won't run away.

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:54.410
I'll protect Min-chan if it kills me.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.160
Yes...

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:00.880
I'll believe you for now.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:04.210
Let's work together for Min-chan's sake

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:05.910
and to keep my secret.

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:08.040
A handshake, huh?

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:10.460
A somewhat heart-racing development.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:12.720
Whoa! What's going on?!

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:15.850
The mobile battery's leaking energy!

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:18.390
If you plug that hole, it leaks from here!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.970
They say the energy levels of 
datalings' mobile batteries

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:23.900
are comparable to five years' worth 
of the entire universe's information!

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:25.440
If we don't get it back under 
control, it'll explode!

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:27.680
Didn't you use crazy powers to make

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:29.900
a meteor of snot the other day?!

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.010
Can't you do something about this?!

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:32.780
I can't use my powers unless I ingest,

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:35.320
digest, and analyze my target!

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:41.150
Brother! I know you're here—

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:42.400
Hurry up and eat.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.980
Wow. This is amazing.

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:46.130
It keeps coming! I can't!

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:46.880
Wh-What a disgraceful sight!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:47.540
Brother!

00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:50.300
Huh? What're you doing here?

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.870
You perverted prince!

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:52.630
Who's that?

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:55.930
I'm the second of three brothers.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.680
This guy may be younger, but he 
surpasses my older brother and me,

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.270
in terms of qualities and 
talents befitting of a king.

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:01.440
He's my little brother.

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:03.650
Wait, I praised him too much!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.190
You're making me blush a bit.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:11.030
<b>Planet Tenaricent
Third Prince: Moemoemoe</b>

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:09.320
The sight of you going crazy over 
a woman is unbearable to watch.

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:11.030
I'm taking this woman with me.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:13.450
That fatty there is a better fit for you!

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:13.740
<b>Planet Tenaricent
Third Prince: Moemoemoe</b>

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:15.750
Wait, that's...

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:16.540
You can't catch me—

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:19.200
What has he done?

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:24.380
We have overcome many great difficulties.

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:27.810
Will we still have to face

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:29.840
even greater dangers in the future?

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:35.440
Don't worry. If it's for Min-chan's sake, 
I can keep working hard forever.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.760
Are you actually a good father?

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:41.150
I actually am.

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:42.270
But...

00:09:43.070 --> 00:09:45.770
I realized that there was too much

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:47.690
I couldn't and didn't do for her.

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:53.330
<i>And it was too late...</i>
